  "lore": [
    "ESPN era 2014\u20132023 \u00b7 Fantrax era 2024\u2013present. 14-team league.",
    "Bill is the all-time wins leader (96-66) and Lord of No Rings \u2014 12-2 with most PF in 2025, lost semis to Kyle.",
    "Kyle Weberg is the only owner with titles in both eras (2023 ESPN, 2025 Fantrax from the 5-seed).",
    "Mike Heff took the first Fantrax cup (2024) and went back-to-back 10-4.",
    "Nate Kelly is the only back-to-back champ (2018\u201319) and owns the best win% among active owners under 90 wins.",
    "Sak posted the best Fantrax regular season (11-3, 3,728 PF) in 2024, went 4-10 in 2025, then retired. Jacob Crisp is the 2026 rookie.",
    "Towner went 6-22 across two Fantrax years and still scored the 6th-most points in 2025 \u2014 then won the Chump.",
    "Bill dropped 408 on Larry (Saltese) in the 2025 playoff opener.",
    "Towner/Aga co-owned 2014\u20132017 and split in 2018.",
    "Kellen sat 2023, returned, and made the 2025 final.",
    "2026 Fantrax names (Bill confirmed): TTAB=Chase, Ultron=Aga, Substation=Nate, Hypersecretors=Jacob Crisp (Sak chair)."
  ]
}
